<title>USA: Textron gets $142.5 mln defense contract.</title>
<headline>Textron gets $142.5 mln defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textron Systems Corp, a unit of Textron Inc, has received a $142.5 million U.S. defense contract for 542 sensor-fused bomb units and other air-dropped smart weapons, the Air Force said.</p>
</text>
